  ('zh_CN', 7, '<ul><li>On Credit Order, Warehouse Order, POS Order (Prepay Order if <i>Generate Shipment</i>): also creates and completes the shipment ✓</li><li>POS Order, On Credit Order (Prepay Order if <i>Generate Invoice</i>): also creates the invoice ✓</li><li>Standard Order: reserves the ordered quantity; shipment and invoice are made next ✓</li><li>Quotation: reserves the quantity and creates nothing else</li><li>Proposal: reserves nothing and creates nothing else</li><li>Prepay Order: waits for a payment (status Waiting Payment)</li><li>Then the next action offered is Close</li></ul>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/LegacyOracleAdapterSpec/" target="_blank">Sales Order …</a></p>', 113),
