  ('zh_CN', 9, '<p><i>Read from iDempiere''s MOrder.java and the dictionary. ✓ = seen in a legacy run of 2026-11-23.</i></p>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/LegacyOracleAdapterSpec/" target="_blank">Sales Order …</a></p>', 154),
  ('zh_CN', 10, '<p><strong>Step 7 · Enter the order header</strong></p>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/ERP_FirstSetup/#step-7-enter-the-order-header" target="_blank">Step 7 · Enter the order header …</a></p>', 154),
  ('zh_CN', 11, '<ol><li value="1">Open <b><b>Sales Order</b></b> (window 143) and click <b>New record</b>.</li><li value="2"><b><b>Business Partner</b></b>: e.g. <i>Joe Block</i>. Choosing it fills <b>Invoice Partner</b> and <b><b>Price List</b></b> automatically (<code>CalloutOrder.bPartner</code>, logged).</li><li value="3"><b>Target Document Type</b>: <b>Standard Order</b>.</li><li value="4">Click <b>Save</b>.</li></ol>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/ERP_FirstSetup/#step-7-enter-the-order-header" target="_blank">Step 7 · Enter the order header …</a></p>', 146),
  ('zh_CN', 12, '<p><strong>Step 9 · Complete the order</strong></p>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/ERP_FirstSetup/#step-9-complete-the-order" target="_blank">Step 9 · Complete the order …</a></p>', 146),
  ('zh_CN', 13, '<ol><li value="1">Go back to the <b><b>Order</b></b> tab. Your order is still the selected record, so there is nothing to look up in the list.</li><li value="2">The form shows the actions that are allowed now: <b>Complete · Prepare · Void</b>. Click <b>Complete</b>.</li></ol>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/ERP_FirstSetup/#step-9-complete-the-order" target="_blank">Step 9 · Complete the order …</a></p>', 146),
  ('zh_CN', 14, '<p>The status becomes <b>Completed (CO)</b>. The change is stored as a signed entry, and the chain check passes (<code>§CRUD process committed … to=CO verifyChain=ok</code>). <b>Reload the page and it is still CO.</b></p>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/ERP_FirstSetup/#step-9-complete-the-order" target="_blank">Step 9 · Complete the order …</a></p>', 146),
  ('zh_CN', 15, '<p><b>What Complete creates depends on the document type, exactly as in iDempiere.</b> A <b>Standard Order</b> creates nothing else on Complete: its shipment and invoice come later (iDempiere''s <i>Generate Shipments</i> / <i>Generate Invoices</i>). A <b>POS Order</b>, <b>Warehouse Order</b> or <b>Credit Order</b> creates its shipment on Complete, and a POS or Credit Order also its invoice.</p>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/ERP_FirstSetup/#step-9-complete-the-order" target="_blank">Step 9 · Complete the order …</a></p>', 146),
