  ('en', 1, '<p><strong>Step 6 · Products, prices, tax and payment terms</strong></p>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/ERP_FirstSetup/#step-6-products-prices-tax-and-payment-terms" target="_blank">Step 6 · Products, prices, tax and payment terms …</a></p>', 186),
  ('en', 2, '<ul><li><b><b>Warehouse</b></b>: the setup made one, <b>HQ Warehouse</b>, with one locator. It shows in <b><b>Warehouse and Locators</b></b> (window 139).</li><li><b><b>Product</b></b> (window 140) needs a <b><b>Tax Category</b></b>. The setup created one (<i>Sales Tax</i> for a United States company), and it is the only one offered in your company.</li><li><b>Payment terms</b>: the setup created <b>Immediate</b> (0 days, the default), as iDempiere''s setup does.</li></ul>', '<p><a href="https://red1oon.github.io/BIMCompiler/ERP_FirstSetup/#step-6-products-prices-tax-and-payment-terms" target="_blank">Step 6 · Products, prices, tax and payment terms …</a></p>', 186),
